    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div>Can you clarify the appropriate syntax for continuous covariates? Your response seems to suggest that the following is correct:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coordinates </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cov</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">map </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cov</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">spdf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;linear&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>however, the tutorial on <a href=\"http://inlabru.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://inlabru.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440661882000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NDYBawUOwV8-E3Vdm0xm0\">inlabru.org</a> suggests this is necessary:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">